  "text": "Veterinarian in Greenville, SC | Upstate Vet Emergency & Specialty Care (UV - Greenville)\nSkip to Primary Content\nMap\n393 Woods Lake Road,\nGreenville,\nSC,\n29607\nCall\n(864) 233-7650\nText\n(864) 233-7650\nEmergency\nEmergency\nPhone:\n(864) 233-7650\nText:\n(864) 233-7650\nAddress:\n393 Woods Lake Road,\nGreenville,\nSC,\n29607\nBlog\nReferral Portal\nCareers\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Team\nCareers\nOur Services\nEmergency & Critical Care\nInternal Medicine\nCardiology\nOncology\nNeurology\nSurgery\nView all Services\nFor Pet Owners\nAppointment Information\nPayment Options\nReturning Patients\nPet Resource Library\nEmergency Registration Form\nFor Veterinarians\nFor Veterinarians\nReferral Portal\nSubscribe to Our Newsletter\nBlood Bank\nEmergency\nContact Us\nExceptional Medicine and\nCompassionate Care in\nGreenville, SC\nContact Us\nWelcome to Upstate Vet\nProviding exceptional veterinary specialty and emergency care for pets in Greenville, Simpsonville, Spartanburg, and the broader Upstate South Carolina, Western North Carolina, Eastern Tennessee, and Northern Georgia regions since 1978.\nCareers\nEmergency Care\nSpecialty Services\nPet Parent Resources\nCareers\nEmergency Care\nSpecialty Services\nPet Parent Resources\nCareers\nEmergency Care\nSpecialty Services\nPet Parent Resources\nCareers\nGive Us A Call\nPhone:\n(864) 233-7650\nText:\n(864) 233-7650\nFax:\n(864) 233-7631\nHours of Operation\nEmergency Hours\nSpecialty Hours\nMon\n8:00am\n-\n2:00am\nTue\n8:00am\n-\n2:00am\nWed\n8:00am\n-\n2:00am\nThu\n8:00am\n-\n2:00am\nFri\n8:00am\n-\n2:00am\nSat\n8:00am\n-\n12:00am\nSun\n8:00am\n-\n12:00am\nOur ER is operating under limited hours. For hospitalized patients, we have a team onsite providing continuous care. Our specialty service hours are Monday-Friday from 8:00am-5:30pm.\nMon\n8:00am\n-\n5:30pm\nTue\n8:00am\n-\n5:30pm\nWed\n8:00am\n-\n5:30pm\nThu\n8:00am\n-\n5:30pm\nFri\n8:00am\n-\n5:30pm\nSat\nClosed\nSun\nClosed\nOur Commitment\nAt Upstate Vet, we understand that pets are members of the family. Our dedicated team of doctors and medical staff provides diagnostic, advanced medical, emergency, and specialty care in partnership with your family veterinarian, helping give your pet a complete healthcare team when they need it most.\nOur Team\nClient Reviews & Testimonials\nWe value feedback from our clients. Here is just a small sample of the hundreds of happy and healthy pets that we have cared for.\n★★★★★\nThey have an amazing staff! They are very knowledgable, compassionate and truly care about animals and their owners. Ross had to spend the night and was taken good care of during his stay.  They called me with updates and provided a plan that helped him recovery quickly so he could get back to doing the things he loves.  Dr. Rathke and the entire staff are wonderful! Thank you all!\nCathy G.\n★★★★★\nDr. Martinez and his team went above and beyond with our German Shepherd, Ringo. We brought Ringo in February and received the devastating news of cancer. Dr. Martinez took the time to cover all our options. The treatment plan we chose put Ringo in complete remission and we were ecstatic when we got to ring the bell!\nTracy H.\n★★★★★\nWe saw Dr. V with our dog that has chronic kidney disease. She was excellent and thoroughly explained the condition, tests done, plan and follow up. Her team is also very kind and helpful. Their care is outstanding!\nDebra M.\nUpstate Vet Emergency & Specialty Care - Greenville\n393 Woods Lake Road\nGreenville\n,\nSC\n29607\nT:\n(864) 233-7650\nF:\n(864) 233-7631\nHours of Operation\nMain Hours\nMon\n8:00am\n-\n2:00am\nTue\n8:00am\n-\n2:00am\nWed\n8:00am\n-\n2:00am\nThu\n8:00am\n-\n2:00am\nFri\n8:00am\n-\n2:00am\nSat\n8:00am\n-\n12:00am\nSun\n8:00am\n-\n12:00am\nOur ER is operating under limited hours. For hospitalized patients, we have a team onsite providing continuous care. Our specialty service hours are Monday-Friday from 8:00am-5:30pm.\nContact Us\nOur Team\nView all Services\nAppointment Information\nFor Veterinarians\nBlood Bank\nTerms & Conditions\nPrivacy Policy\nAccessibility\nContact Us\nCookie Preferences\nDo Not Sell or Share My Information\n©\nCopyright\n2026",
